20076bdb-e422-482b-8c36-ecf3da5de2df	Assignment_ML-II.pdf	170236	application/pdf	circulars	20076bdb-e422-482b-8c36-ecf3da5de2df/Assignment_ML-II.pdf	Assignment ML-II	Vivekananda College of Engineering & Technology Assignment\r\nVCET\r\n[A unit of Vivekananda Vidyavardhaka Sangha, Puttur ®]\r\nAI\r\nAffiliated to Visvesvaraya Technological University, Belagavi\r\n30/09/26\r\nApproved by AICTE, New Delhi & Govt of Karnataka\r\nAssignment\r\nDept: AI Sem: VII Sub: Machine Learning-II S Code: BAI702\r\nDate: 30/09/2026 Max Marks: 05\r\n-\r\nQN Questions Marks RBT CO's\r\n1 Explain how noise points can distort cluster centroids in K-Means. Also 01 L2 CO3\r\ndescribe the method used to reduce the impact of noisy data in clustering.\r\n2 Describe SOM algorithm. 01 L2 CO4\r\n3 Explain why sampling is important in probabilistic modelling. 01 L2 CO4\r\n4 Describe the difference between exact and approximate inference. 01 L2 CO4\r\n5 Explain the main components of a Hidden Markov Model. 01 L2 CO4\r\nSubmit the assignment on or before 22/10/2026\r\nFaculty in charge: Ms. Vaishnavi K V\r\nNehru Nagar, Puttur - 574 203, DK, Karnataka State – INDIA.\r\nPhone :+91-8251-235955, 234555 Fax : 236444, Web: www.vcetputtur.ac.in,E mail:principal@vcetputtur.ac.in	{}	AIML	circular	3	\N	1	t	active	{"all_dates": [{"date": "2026-10-22T00:00:00", "days_until": 13, "date_string": "22/10/2026"}], "manual_due_date": "2026-10-22T17:00:00", "auto_extracted_date": "2026-10-22T00:00:00", "extracted_text_length": 1019}	2026-10-08 14:28:53.18984+05:30	\N
